-- The Mulgore CoA quests carried only their turn-in POI, so the map showed no objective area or marker until a quest
-- was complete. Each objective now gets an area like a stock quest (ObjectiveIndex 0-3 for creature or gameobject
-- credit, 4-9 for items), drawn as a padded outline around the spawns of what grants it: the creature or object
-- itself, the creatures and chests whose loot holds the item, the object or creature whose script gives the hidden
-- credit, or the area trigger of an exploration objective. The turn-in POI stays as it was; Stay a While gains one.
DELETE FROM `quest_poi` WHERE `QuestID` IN (
    1660030, 1660031, 1660032, 1660033, 1660034, 1660035, 1660043, 1660066,
    1660067, 1660068, 1660069, 1660070
);
